-- (4): how an enforcement order is carried out.
DECLARE `o 22 r 6(4) kind of enforcement order` IS ONE OF
    `o 22 r 6(4)(a) an enforcement order for delivery or possession of movable property`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(b) an enforcement order for seizure and sale of movable property`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(c) an enforcement order for the possession of immovable property`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(d) an enforcement order for seizure and sale of immovable property`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(e) an enforcement order for attachment of a debt due from a non-party that is a financial institution as represented by a deposit of money`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(f) an enforcement order for attachment of a debt due from any other non-party`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(g) an enforcement order for seizure and sale of bonds, shares or other securities or membership in a club or society`
    `o 22 r 6(4) another enforcement order`

DECLARE `o 22 r 6(4) step` IS ONE OF
    `o 22 r 6(4)(a) taking physical possession of the movable property`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(a) affixing the Sheriff's seal on the movable property`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(b)(i) affixing the Sheriff's seal on the movable property`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(b)(ii) serving a notice of seizure on the person or entity having possession or control of the movable property or leaving a notice of seizure at the place where the movable property was seized`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(c) posting a notice of seizure on some conspicuous part of the immovable property`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(c) entering and taking possession of the immovable property`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(c) serving a notice of seizure on the persons who are present and in actual possession or control of the immovable property`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(d) serving a notice of seizure on the Singapore Land Authority in respect of title to the immovable property`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(d)(i) the enforcement applicant separately registering the enforcement order within 14 days after service of the notice of seizure`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(d)(ii) the enforcement applicant giving notice in writing to the Sheriff that the enforcement order has been duly registered`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(e) serving a notice of attachment on the financial institution in respect of the deposit in such institution`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(f) serving a notice of attachment on the non-party from which money is due to the enforcement respondent`
    `o 22 r 6(4)(g) serving a notice of seizure on the person or entity which registers the ownership or the membership`
    `o 22 r 6(4) another step`

-- Each sub-paragraph is "in respect of" one kind of order and says by what the Sheriff carries it out.  In (a) the two
-- steps are alternatives ("or"), in (b) and (d) the steps go together ("and"), in (c) they are listed together;
-- this function says only whether a step is one the paragraph lists for that kind.
-- src:3452 | (4) An enforcement order is carried out by the Sheriff — ( a )
-- src:3453 | in respect of an enforcement order for delivery or possession of movable property — by taking physical possession of the movable property or affixing the Sheriff’s seal on the movable property;
-- src:3454 | ( b )
-- src:3455 | in respect of an enforcement order for seizure and sale of movable property — (i)
-- src:3456 | by affixing the Sheriff’s seal on the movable property; and
-- src:3457 | (ii)
-- src:3458 | by serving a notice of seizure on the person or entity having possession or control of the movable property or leaving a notice of seizure at the place where the movable property was seized;
-- src:3459 | ( c )
-- src:3460 | in respect of an enforcement order for the possession of immovable property — by posting a notice of seizure on some conspicuous part of the immovable property and entering and taking possession of the immovable property and, where applicable, by serving a notice of seizure on the persons who are present and in actual possession or control of the immovable property;
-- src:3461 | ( d )
-- src:3462 | in respect of an enforcement order for seizure and sale of immovable property — by serving a notice of seizure on the Singapore Land Authority in respect of title to the immovable property, and with the enforcement applicant — (i)
-- src:3463 | separately registering the enforcement order under any written law relating to the immovable property within 14 days after service of the notice of seizure; and
-- src:3464 | (ii)
-- src:3465 | giving notice in writing to the Sheriff that the enforcement order has been duly registered;
-- src:3466 | ( e )
-- src:3467 | in respect of an enforcement order for attachment of a debt due to the enforcement respondent from a non‑party that is a financial institution as represented by a deposit of money, whether or not the deposit has matured and despite any restriction as to the mode of withdrawal — by serving a notice of attachment on the financial institution in respect of the deposit in such institution;
-- src:3468 | ( f )
-- src:3469 | in respect of an enforcement order for attachment of a debt due to the enforcement respondent from any other non‑party — by serving a notice of attachment on the non‑party from which money is due to the enforcement respondent, whether the money is due immediately or at some future date or at certain intervals in the future; or
-- src:3470 | ( g )
-- src:3471 | in respect of an enforcement order for seizure and sale of bonds, shares or other securities or membership in a club or society — by serving a notice of seizure on the person or entity which registers the ownership in respect of the bonds, shares or other securities, or which registers the membership in the club or society.
@ref O 22 r 6(4) (src:3452-3471)
GIVEN kind IS A `o 22 r 6(4) kind of enforcement order`
      step IS A `o 22 r 6(4) step`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `o 22 r 6(4)(a) an enforcement order for delivery or possession of movable property` THEN
        IF step EQUALS `o 22 r 6(4)(a) taking physical possession of the movable property` OR step EQUALS `o 22 r 6(4)(a) affixing the Sheriff's seal on the movable property`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "in respect of an enforcement order for delivery or possession of movable property — by taking physical possession of the movable property or affixing the Sheriff’s seal on the movable property"
    WHEN `o 22 r 6(4)(b) an enforcement order for seizure and sale of movable property` THEN
        IF step EQUALS `o 22 r 6(4)(b)(i) affixing the Sheriff's seal on the movable property` OR step EQUALS `o 22 r 6(4)(b)(ii) serving a notice of seizure on the person or entity having possession or control of the movable property or leaving a notice of seizure at the place where the movable property was seized`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "in respect of an enforcement order for seizure and sale of movable property — (i) by affixing the Sheriff’s seal on the movable property; and (ii) by serving a notice of seizure"
    WHEN `o 22 r 6(4)(c) an enforcement order for the possession of immovable property` THEN
        IF step EQUALS `o 22 r 6(4)(c) posting a notice of seizure on some conspicuous part of the immovable property` OR step EQUALS `o 22 r 6(4)(c) entering and taking possession of the immovable property` OR step EQUALS `o 22 r 6(4)(c) serving a notice of seizure on the persons who are present and in actual possession or control of the immovable property`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "in respect of an enforcement order for the possession of immovable property — by posting a notice of seizure on some conspicuous part of the immovable property and entering and taking possession of the immovable property"
    WHEN `o 22 r 6(4)(d) an enforcement order for seizure and sale of immovable property` THEN
        IF step EQUALS `o 22 r 6(4)(d) serving a notice of seizure on the Singapore Land Authority in respect of title to the immovable property` OR step EQUALS `o 22 r 6(4)(d)(i) the enforcement applicant separately registering the enforcement order within 14 days after service of the notice of seizure` OR step EQUALS `o 22 r 6(4)(d)(ii) the enforcement applicant giving notice in writing to the Sheriff that the enforcement order has been duly registered`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "in respect of an enforcement order for seizure and sale of immovable property — by serving a notice of seizure on the Singapore Land Authority in respect of title to the immovable property"
    WHEN `o 22 r 6(4)(e) an enforcement order for attachment of a debt due from a non-party that is a financial institution as represented by a deposit of money` THEN
        IF step EQUALS `o 22 r 6(4)(e) serving a notice of attachment on the financial institution in respect of the deposit in such institution`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "by serving a notice of attachment on the financial institution in respect of the deposit in such institution"
    WHEN `o 22 r 6(4)(f) an enforcement order for attachment of a debt due from any other non-party` THEN
        IF step EQUALS `o 22 r 6(4)(f) serving a notice of attachment on the non-party from which money is due to the enforcement respondent`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "by serving a notice of attachment on the non‑party from which money is due to the enforcement respondent"
    WHEN `o 22 r 6(4)(g) an enforcement order for seizure and sale of bonds, shares or other securities or membership in a club or society` THEN
        IF step EQUALS `o 22 r 6(4)(g) serving a notice of seizure on the person or entity which registers the ownership or the membership`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "by serving a notice of seizure on the person or entity which registers the ownership in respect of the bonds, shares or other securities, or which registers the membership in the club or society"
    WHEN `o 22 r 6(4) another enforcement order` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): paragraph (4) lists seven kinds of enforcement order and no more

`o 22 r 6(4)(d)(i) the period for registering the enforcement order` MEANS Period WITH
    `period length` IS 14
    `period unit` IS Days
    `period direction` IS `After the anchor`

-- src:3462 | in respect of an enforcement order for seizure and sale of immovable property — by serving a notice of seizure on the Singapore Land Authority in respect of title to the immovable property, and with the enforcement applicant — (i)
-- src:3463 | separately registering the enforcement order under any written law relating to the immovable property within 14 days after service of the notice of seizure; and
@ref O 22 r 6(4)(d)(i) (src:3462-3463)
GIVEN `the date the enforcement order is separately registered` IS A DATE
      `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 22 r 6(4)(d)(i) the enforcement order is registered in time` MEANS
    IF `the date the enforcement order is separately registered` AT MOST `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "separately registering the enforcement order under any written law relating to the immovable property within 14 days after service of the notice of seizure" [period, ruled 2026-11-05 (a)]

