        IF `the day asked about` GREATER THAN `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "after 14 days after a copy of the notice of seizure has been served on the enforcement respondent under Rule 6" [period, ruled 2026-11-05 (a)]

